---
import Icon from "../common/Icon.astro";
import "../../styles/footprints.css";
---

<div class="cc" id="footprints-sheet" data-footprints aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="cc-backdrop" data-close></div>
  <section
    class="cc-sheet fp-sheet"
    role="dialog"
    aria-modal="true"
    aria-labelledby="fp-title"
    tabindex="-1"
  >
    <header class="cc-head">
      <h2 id="fp-title">我的足迹</h2>
      <div class="cc-head-actions">
        <button
          class="cc-reset-btn"
          type="button"
          data-fp-clear
          data-tip="清空本地浏览、评论与喜欢记录"
          hidden
        >
          清空
        </button>
        <button
          class="cc-close-btn"
          type="button"
          data-close
          aria-label="关闭我的足迹"
        >
          <Icon name="close" size={15} />
        </button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="fp-identity">
      <div class="fp-id-left">
        <span class="fp-avatar-wrap">
          <img
            class="fp-avatar"
            data-fp-avatar
            data-img-placeholder-ignore
            width="34"
            height="34"
            alt=""
            hidden
          />
          <span class="fp-initial" data-fp-initial aria-hidden="true">访</span>
        </span>
        <div class="fp-id-copy">
          <div class="fp-name-row">
            <span class="fp-name" data-fp-name>访客</span>
            <span class="fp-role" data-fp-role data-mode="anonymous">访客</span>
          </div>
          <span class="fp-sub" data-fp-sub>足迹仅保存在当前浏览器</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a class="fp-login-btn" href="/login" data-no-swup data-fp-login>
        <span>登录账号</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="fp-toolbar">
      <div class="fp-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="足迹分类">
        <button
          type="button"
          class="fp-tab is-active"
          role="tab"
          aria-selected="true"
          data-fp-tab="all"
        >
          <span>全部</span>
        </button>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="fp-tab"
          role="tab"
          aria-selected="false"
          data-fp-tab="visits"
        >
          <span>阅读</span>
          <span class="fp-tab-num num" data-fp-count="visits">0</span>
        </button>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="fp-tab"
          role="tab"
          aria-selected="false"
          data-fp-tab="comments"
        >
          <span>评论</span>
          <span class="fp-tab-num num" data-fp-count="comments">0</span>
        </button>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="fp-tab"
          role="tab"
          aria-selected="false"
          data-fp-tab="likes"
        >
          <span>喜欢</span>
          <span class="fp-tab-num num" data-fp-count="likes">0</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="fp-body">
      <ul class="fp-list" data-fp-list hidden></ul>
      <div class="fp-empty" data-fp-empty>
        <p>还没有留下足迹，随便逛逛文章或留下一条评论吧。</p>
        <button type="button" class="fp-empty-btn" data-fp-random>
          <Icon name="shuffle" size={13} />
          <span>随机读一篇</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="fp-foot">
      <span>仅保存在当前浏览器，不会上传至服务器</span>
    </footer>
  </section>
</div>
